// shader-differential — control shader B (the deliberate mismatch).
//
// A different solid color from sd_ctrl_a: every pixel differs, by a
// large per-channel delta, so the control-mismatch row exercises the
// comparator across the full RT rather than at a boundary.  Also kept
// away from both sentinels.

void main(out float4 out_color : COLOR)
{
    out_color = float4(0.75f, 0.25f, 0.5f, 1.0f);
}
